# Pairs with LastAdminGuard. The superseded design: commit the removal, then
# re-grant the entry when the set came out empty. Between the two writes the
# tenant has no admin, and the refusal reports a write.
MODULE: RepairByRemoveThenRegrant
TARGET: LastAdminGuard
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an emptying removal is written and then repaired instead of refused
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
          THEN /\ pending' = [pending EXCEPT ![p] = None]
               /\ obs' = [kind |-> "call", op |-> op.kind, result |-> "refused", wrote |-> FALSE]
               /\ UNCHANGED <<slots, clock, groupExists, bindings, removed, budget>>
--- REPLACE
          THEN /\ slots' = merged
               /\ pending' = [pending EXCEPT ![p] = None]
               /\ obs' = [kind |-> "call", op |-> op.kind, result |-> "refused", wrote |-> TRUE]
               /\ UNCHANGED <<clock, groupExists, bindings, removed, budget>>
--- END